---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Form Setu">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">Last updated 3 August 2026</p>

  <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink">

    <div class="rounded-lg border-l-4 border-pass bg-pass-bg p-4">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-pass">Your photos never leave your device</h2>
      <p class="mt-1">Our resizing tools run entirely in your browser using your device's own processing. Your photo, signature, thumb impression and documents are never uploaded, transmitted, stored or seen by us.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">What we collect</h2>
    <p>We do not ask for or store your name, email address, phone number, roll number, registration number or any other personal identifier. You can use every tool on this site without telling us anything about yourself.</p>
    <p>We do collect anonymous information about how the site is used, through the two services below.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Google Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics 4, loaded through Google Tag Manager, to understand which pages people visit and which exams they are looking for. This helps us decide which exams and guides to add next.</p>
    <p>Google Analytics sets cookies on your device and collects information such as the pages you view, how long you stay, your approximate location at city level, your device type and browser, and the website that referred you. It assigns your browser a random identifier so that repeat visits can be counted, but this is not linked to your name or any account.</p>
    <p>We have not enabled Google Signals, advertising features or demographic reporting. We do not use this data to build a profile of you, and we do not sell it or share it with anyone.</p>
    <p>Google processes this data as our service provider. You can read <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="font-semibold text-navy-700 underline">Google's privacy policy</a> for how they handle it.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Cloudflare Web Analytics</h2>
    <p>We also use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies and does not track individuals across websites. It records aggregate page views, referring site, country and browser type only.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">How to opt out</h2>
    <p>You can stop Google Analytics collecting data about your visit in any of these ways:</p>
    <ul class="ml-4 list-disc space-y-1">
      <li>Install the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="font-semibold text-navy-700 underline">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a></li>
      <li>Block cookies for this site in your browser settings</li>
      <li>Use your browser's private or incognito mode</li>
      <li>Use any standard content or tracker blocker</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The tools on this site work exactly the same either way. Nothing here requires you to accept tracking.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Cookies we set</h2>
    <p>We do not set any cookies of our own. The only cookies placed while you use this site come from Google Analytics, as described above. We do not use advertising or retargeting cookies.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">External links</h2>
    <p>We link to official examination websites and to Amazon. Once you follow those links, their privacy policies apply, not ours.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Amazon Associates</h2>
    <p>Form Setu participates in the Amazon Associates Program. When you follow a product link, Amazon may set a cookie to attribute a purchase to us. We receive only aggregate commission data, never information about who you are or what you bought.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Data retention</h2>
    <p>Analytics data is retained by Google for up to 14 months and then deleted automatically. Because your files are never uploaded, there is nothing of yours for us to retain.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Children</h2>
    <p>This site is intended for people applying to examinations and is not directed at children under 13.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Your rights</h2>
    <p>Because we do not collect personal information that identifies you, we generally hold nothing to give you access to or delete. If you believe we hold information about you and want it removed, email us and we will act on it.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Changes</h2>
    <p>If we add advertising or any service that collects additional data, we will update this page and change the date above before doing so.</p>

    <p class="pt-2">Questions: <a href="mailto:contact@formsetu.com" class="font-semibold text-navy-700 underline">contact@formsetu.com</a></p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>